01:31.447 --> 01:36.457
The Promise That Was Kept

02:33.557 --> 02:35.967
I will never go over
to your side!

02:36.967 --> 02:39.557
I have no regrets with
my path up until now.

02:40.467 --> 02:45.007
I told you I saw everything.

02:47.137 --> 02:48.097
So...

02:49.257 --> 02:50.387
don't...

02:53.097 --> 02:55.387
keep imagining yourself as Hokage!

03:14.007 --> 03:17.507
The person Rin wanted to watch over
isn't the current you...

03:18.807 --> 03:19.967
It was Obito Uchiha.

03:34.097 --> 03:37.307
<i>We're late again because</i>
<i>of you... Obito.</i>

03:37.927 --> 03:38.927
<i>Let's go, Obito.</i>

03:40.847 --> 03:42.637
<i>Sorry! We'll be right there.</i>

03:44.057 --> 03:45.057
Rin...

04:09.427 --> 04:09.927
That's right...

04:10.677 --> 04:13.507
You ought to fill in that hole
in your heart yourself...

04:14.467 --> 04:16.967
Others will be of no help.

04:19.057 --> 04:21.807
So... come over here.

04:22.467 --> 04:24.387
I won't ignore you.

04:25.007 --> 04:25.717
Come...

04:25.967 --> 04:26.847
Come...

04:27.097 --> 04:28.007
Obito...

04:28.097 --> 04:29.007
Hold on, Rin!

04:34.967 --> 04:38.757
That's right... Rin won't even turn
to look at the current you.

04:39.097 --> 04:42.347
The one Rin wanted to watch over
is Obito Uchiha.

04:44.217 --> 04:45.507
Enough already...

04:46.307 --> 04:46.927
I am...

04:48.847 --> 04:50.137
Obito Uchiha!

04:50.427 --> 04:53.007
Now just come over, you bastard!

04:54.467 --> 04:55.967
Everyone's power...

06:04.807 --> 06:06.137
Don't you dare underestimate it!

06:07.097 --> 06:08.257
They're out!

06:16.427 --> 06:18.467
– All right!
– We did it!

06:18.717 --> 06:20.507
– We did it!
– We did it!

06:20.757 --> 06:22.887
Yes!

06:40.757 --> 06:44.097
<i>Did I... lose?</i>

07:19.347 --> 07:21.507
<i>The gaping hole of hell</i>
<i>that has opened</i>

07:21.597 --> 07:23.677
<i>will be filled by</i>
<i>the moon's dreams...</i>

07:25.097 --> 07:27.637
<i>There's nothing in my heart!</i>

07:28.007 --> 07:30.177
<i>I don't even feel pain anymore.</i>

07:31.887 --> 07:34.257
<i>Don't feel so guilty, Kakashi.</i>

07:34.967 --> 07:38.677
<i>This hole was opened</i>
<i>by this hellish world.</i>

07:39.507 --> 07:41.637
<i>Do you really think that</i>
<i>something like this</i>

07:41.717 --> 07:44.007
<i>can fill that hole in your heart?!</i>

07:46.097 --> 07:48.257
<i>Don't erase the memories</i>
<i>of the real Rin!</i>

07:49.967 --> 07:53.097
<i>Rin sacrificed herself to protect</i>
<i>and save the village!</i>

07:54.637 --> 07:57.177
<i>You can try and fill that hole</i>
<i>with delusions all by yourself...</i>

07:58.307 --> 08:00.307
<i>But that hole will never be filled!</i>

08:03.097 --> 08:07.307
<i>The hole in one's heart gets filled</i>
<i>by others around you.</i>

08:22.427 --> 08:23.307
Let's go.

08:44.137 --> 08:45.137
Rin...

09:09.037 --> 09:12.827
You kept your promise,
Naruto Uzumaki!

09:13.537 --> 09:16.787
<i>That's why I want</i>
<i>to save you too...</i>

09:17.577 --> 09:20.827
And you really rescued us!

09:21.537 --> 09:22.617
Right, Son!

09:24.077 --> 09:25.537
We were lucky.

09:26.157 --> 09:27.367
He did it.

09:27.827 --> 09:29.117
For real.

09:29.537 --> 09:30.447
You're right.

09:30.487 --> 09:31.537
I'm so glad!

09:34.657 --> 09:36.697
Isn't he...?

09:51.407 --> 09:52.537
H-Hey!

09:53.037 --> 09:54.237
Wait, Sasuke!

09:55.577 --> 09:57.487
Where is he?!
Where'd he go?!

09:58.197 --> 10:00.367
Over there! He's still alive!

10:10.407 --> 10:13.077
<i>Right... I've lost...</i>

10:20.657 --> 10:21.487
Kakashi!

10:22.407 --> 10:25.327
Sasuke, we'll talk later.

10:26.037 --> 10:27.487
I apologize for appearing
so suddenly...

10:28.197 --> 10:30.697
But I was once
his classmate and friend...

10:31.327 --> 10:33.157
So please let me
take responsibility for him.

10:35.657 --> 10:36.537
Kakashi Sensei!

10:36.987 --> 10:37.987
He's now—!

10:45.617 --> 10:46.447
Dad!

10:49.577 --> 10:50.827
He's weak now!

10:51.197 --> 10:53.237
Now's the time to finish him!

10:53.407 --> 10:54.037
Let's go!

10:54.197 --> 10:54.987
– Right!
– Right!

10:55.077 --> 10:55.697
Hold it!

11:04.117 --> 11:05.037
Obito...

11:10.907 --> 11:12.737
When we had that
chakra tug-of-war just now,

11:13.237 --> 11:15.617
I got to see inside your heart.

11:18.537 --> 11:21.537
It seems like my son nagged
and lectured you quite a bit.

11:22.287 --> 11:24.947
I think he might have gotten that
from his mother.

11:26.197 --> 11:27.037
Dad...

11:28.447 --> 11:31.657
But that duty actually falls...
on you.

11:35.157 --> 11:37.237
I think the one who truly
understands Obito

11:37.447 --> 11:39.287
and should talk to him...

11:40.327 --> 11:42.947
is you, his friend... Kakashi.

11:48.077 --> 11:49.537
Isn't that right, Naruto?

12:09.157 --> 12:11.487
Naruto, you two and
the Allied Forces should go

12:11.577 --> 12:15.617
and help Lord First,
and seal Madara away.

12:16.237 --> 12:18.537
Oh, right! We still need
to deal with him!

12:19.367 --> 12:20.617
Let's go, Sasuke!

12:22.947 --> 12:25.987
I think you were younger
than Naruto is now.

12:27.617 --> 12:28.867
Do you remember?

12:29.407 --> 12:31.537
All the missions that
the four of us went on?

12:32.407 --> 12:37.037
As a Medic Ninja, Rin did
her utmost to protect you two.

12:38.037 --> 12:40.487
She would never have wished
for a situation like this.

12:51.617 --> 12:55.787
But what caused this
is my responsibility.

13:02.037 --> 13:04.287
<i>Can I start explaining</i>
<i>the mission to you?</i>

13:04.907 --> 13:06.657
<i>We're close to the border.</i>

13:11.947 --> 13:13.787
<i>All right, it's this line.</i>

13:14.947 --> 13:17.737
<i>It shows where the Land of Earth</i>
<i>is currently invading</i>

13:17.827 --> 13:19.577
<i>the Hidden Grass Village.</i>

13:20.197 --> 13:22.487
<i>Hidden Stone Shinobi</i>
<i>are our enemies...</i>

13:23.287 --> 13:25.197
<i>We have received intel</i>
<i>that 1000 ninja</i>

13:25.287 --> 13:27.197
<i>already make up the front line.</i>

13:28.447 --> 13:30.447
<i>They've advanced farther</i>
<i>than last time.</i>

13:31.487 --> 13:33.907
<i>The Land of Fire shares borders</i>
<i>with the Hidden Grass.</i>

13:33.987 --> 13:36.407
<i>We should have stepped</i>
<i>in long ago.</i>

13:37.447 --> 13:40.197
<i>Judging by the size of this advance...</i>

13:40.577 --> 13:43.987
<i>they must have an efficient system</i>
<i>for reinforcement.</i>

13:44.537 --> 13:48.367
<i>Hence, our mission is here...</i>
<i>at Kannabi Bridge.</i>

13:49.487 --> 13:51.327
<i>To crush one's enemy</i>
<i>at the battlefront</i>

13:51.407 --> 13:53.237
<i>requires an immense number</i>
<i>of ninja.</i>

13:54.287 --> 13:57.117
<i>So shinobi like us,</i>
<i>who focus on sabotage missions,</i>

13:57.197 --> 13:59.197
<i>are forced to work in small,</i>
<i>select teams.</i>

13:59.787 --> 14:01.447
<i>The bridge... you say?</i>

14:03.197 --> 14:05.487
<i>Then it's an infiltration mission?</i>

14:09.077 --> 14:10.077
<i>Team Kakashi...</i>

14:10.157 --> 14:13.487
<i>Your mission is to infiltrate</i>
<i>the enemy's rear territory.</i>

14:13.947 --> 14:16.737
<i>You will destroy this bridge</i>

14:16.827 --> 14:19.117
<i>which is used to transport supplies</i>
<i>and reinforcements.</i>

14:19.197 --> 14:21.157
<i>And when this is done,</i>
<i>withdraw immediately.</i>

14:22.077 --> 14:23.077
– <i>Yes, sir!</i>
– <i>Yes, sir!</i>

14:26.697 --> 14:27.697
<i>And you, Sensei?</i>

14:28.407 --> 14:31.287
<i>I will face the enemy directly</i>
<i>on the battlefront.</i>

14:31.487 --> 14:33.537
<i>I'll create a diversion for you.</i>

14:34.447 --> 14:37.537
<i>In any case,</i>
<i>Kakashi is your captain today.</i>

14:38.077 --> 14:39.787
<i>We'll travel together to the border,</i>

14:39.867 --> 14:42.617
<i>but after that</i>
<i>your mission commences!</i>

14:44.407 --> 14:45.117
– <i>Yes, sir!</i>
– <i>Yes, sir!</i>

14:47.237 --> 14:48.987
<i>We'll be splitting up into</i>
<i>two teams from this point.</i>

14:49.287 --> 14:50.487
<i>Good luck to you all.</i>

14:51.117 --> 14:54.237
<i>The enemy the other day was</i>
<i>doing surveillance alone.</i>

14:54.697 --> 14:56.537
<i>But here on out,</i>
<i>we'll be fighting teams.</i>

14:56.947 --> 14:57.787
<i>Be careful...</i>

14:58.987 --> 15:01.487
<i>Let's get going, Captain.</i>

15:16.787 --> 15:19.077
It's no coincidence that I,
who should be dead,

15:19.157 --> 15:21.327
am standing before
you two like this.

15:22.077 --> 15:23.617
Perhaps it was Rin
who made it happen...

15:24.037 --> 15:26.907
Her way of scolding me
for failing as your teacher.

15:35.447 --> 15:38.487
I'm sorry I couldn't protect Rin.

15:51.947 --> 15:52.987
Rin...

15:54.037 --> 15:57.327
Rin was my only light and hope.

15:59.487 --> 16:01.287
After I lost Rin...

16:01.867 --> 16:04.327
The world as I saw it, changed.

16:05.327 --> 16:06.867
It became a pitch black hell.

16:07.867 --> 16:09.827
There's no hope in this world.

16:11.157 --> 16:13.657
I took Madara's identity
and walked the world.

16:14.617 --> 16:17.367
But all it did was confirm my belief.

16:18.117 --> 16:22.487
Even with my Sharingan,
I couldn't see anything...

16:23.447 --> 16:25.237
There was nothing to see.

16:29.077 --> 16:30.907
I don't know anything
for sure either...

16:34.537 --> 16:37.577
Then... my new path is—!

16:37.657 --> 16:42.117
Without a doubt,
your path is just one of many.

16:43.447 --> 16:46.237
And it may not actually
be wrong either.

16:52.737 --> 16:55.197
I've thought this world was hell too.

16:56.537 --> 16:58.577
I thought that you had died...

16:59.367 --> 17:01.287
And right after that, I lost Rin...

17:02.157 --> 17:04.487
And I lost Minato Sensei as well.

17:06.697 --> 17:07.447
But...

17:13.407 --> 17:16.827
<i>Oh yeah... I forgot...</i>

17:20.367 --> 17:25.487
<i>I was the only one</i>
<i>who didn't give you a gift...</i>

17:26.287 --> 17:29.287
<i>for becoming a Jonin, Kakashi.</i>

17:32.737 --> 17:35.697
<i>I was wondering...</i>
<i>what to give you...</i>

17:37.487 --> 17:41.157
<i>and I just had a thought.</i>

17:42.617 --> 17:44.487
<i>Don't worry...</i>

17:45.367 --> 17:49.537
<i>It's not some useless,</i>
<i>extra baggage...</i>

17:52.947 --> 17:58.697
<i>I'm giving you... my Sharingan.</i>

18:02.117 --> 18:05.987
<i>Whatever the village may say,</i>

18:06.077 --> 18:09.157
<i>you are a great Jonin.</i>

18:09.947 --> 18:12.487
<i>That's how I really feel...</i>

18:13.867 --> 18:15.197
<i>So please accept it.</i>

18:17.577 --> 18:19.237
Even though I don't know
anything for sure...

18:19.617 --> 18:21.657
I tried my best to see
the world with this eye.

18:22.907 --> 18:26.157
I felt that as long as I had
your Sharingan and words...

18:26.237 --> 18:27.827
I could see it.

18:32.197 --> 18:35.537
And what you saw is Naruto?

18:36.577 --> 18:39.657
How can you be sure
his path won't fail?

18:42.657 --> 18:43.737
No...

18:45.077 --> 18:48.577
He may very well fail too.
Of course.

18:52.447 --> 18:54.657
How is Naruto different from me?

18:55.537 --> 18:57.157
Why do you go so far for him?

18:57.287 --> 18:59.487
Because I can say
without hesitation

18:59.577 --> 19:02.577
that he is less likely to fail
than the current you.

19:02.697 --> 19:03.737
Why is that?!

19:07.827 --> 19:11.447
Because if he trips and stumbles
on his path...

19:11.537 --> 19:12.447
I'll help him.

19:17.367 --> 19:20.077
Why would you help him?

19:30.577 --> 19:35.537
He would never give up
on his dreams... or on reality.

19:37.157 --> 19:38.577
That's the kind of guy he is.

19:39.157 --> 19:40.237
Found him!

19:42.367 --> 19:46.407
And the way he forges ahead
draws others towards him.

19:47.157 --> 19:49.327
He makes you want to reach out
when he's about to stumble.

19:49.827 --> 19:52.037
And the greater
the support behind you,

19:52.117 --> 19:53.947
the closer you can get to your goal.

19:55.287 --> 19:56.617
That's the difference.

20:18.447 --> 20:20.237
Massive Rasen Shuriken!

20:20.407 --> 20:23.157
Bigger! We'll go with something
even bigger!

20:23.487 --> 20:24.237
– Right!
– Right!

20:27.987 --> 20:32.407
Do you really believe
such a thing is possible

20:32.487 --> 20:34.447
in this pitch-black hell?

20:34.697 --> 20:37.537
I'm sure you could've seen it too,
if you had tried.

20:38.617 --> 20:41.537
After all,
you and I have the same eyes.

20:43.907 --> 20:45.987
If comrades that you trust,
gather around you...

20:46.407 --> 20:49.487
hope can take physical form
and become visible.

20:52.487 --> 20:54.697
That's what I believe...

20:57.987 --> 20:59.487
Obito.

